# Frontend

- Vue 3 `<script setup>` + Pinia. Aliases `@` and `@shared`.
- Ranking state only in `client/src/stores/project.ts`. Per-app stores under `client/src/apps/*/stores/`.
- Shared UI in `client/src/components/ui/` must stay presentational (no Pinia).
- Reuse `style.css` tokens/classes and `docs/ui-design-system.md` components before new primitives.
- Preview/export ranking visuals: change `drawOverlay.ts` / `format.ts` / `shared/frame.ts` / `shared/timeline.ts`, not one-off Vue math.
- Uploads: `FileDropZone` + `FileStatusBox`. Booleans: `ToggleSwitch`. Settings: `SettingsAccordion` / `AppSettingsTabs`.
